      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on choosing + evaluating a performance marketing agency for B2C Brand (F&B, Wellness, Home, Fitness, Electronics, Lifestyle, DTC-any) brands in Hyderabad, India 2026 &mdash; costs in INR, CPL benchmarks, channel mix, creative velocity, attribution, and how ITD GrowthLabs runs performance marketing for entrepreneurs + founders + marketing managers.</p>
