    <div class="itdgl-pm-intro">
      <p>Choosing + Evaluating a Performance Marketing Agency for B2C Brand (F&B, Wellness, Home, Fitness, Electronics, Lifestyle, DTC-any) brands in Hyderabad, India 2026 is where scaling B2C revenue is unlocked. Channel mix: Meta + Instagram + Reels + TikTok + YouTube + Google Shopping + PMax + Snapchat (KSA) + WhatsApp + creator + affiliate. Peak-season concentration: Diwali + wedding + festive (India), Ramadan + Eid + DSF (GCC), Christmas + Black Friday + Cyber Monday + Boxing Day (UK). For entrepreneurs, founders, and marketing managers running B2C Brand (F&B, Wellness, Home, Fitness, Electronics, Lifestyle, DTC-any) brands in Hyderabad, this guide answers 12 questions on Performance Marketing Agency — costs in INR, CPL benchmarks, creative velocity, attribution, and how ITD GrowthLabs runs Choosing + Evaluating a Performance Marketing Agency for B2C Brand (Generic) brands.</p><p>Reference AOV bands: India Rs 500-10,000 (mass + premium), Rs 3,000-50,000 (electronics + fitness + home). GCC AED 80-1,500 (mass + premium), AED 500-15,000 (electronics + fitness + home). UK £25-500 (mass + premium), £150-5,000 (electronics + fitness + home). Ad range in Hyderabad: Rs 1.5-14 lakh/month. CPL: Rs 50-1,500 (India), AED 4-100 (GCC), £3-90 (UK) depending on sub-category + AOV.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD PERFORMANCE MARKETING &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong>
      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-funnel performance marketing for B2C Brand (F&B, Wellness, Home, Fitness, Electronics, Lifestyle, DTC-any) brands across India, GCC, and UK. Meta + Instagram + Reels + Google + Shopping + Performance Max + TikTok + Snapchat + WhatsApp CTWA + creator + influencer + LTV/CAC/cohort attribution. Grounded in Rs 8+ Cr annual managed ad spend across 100+ B2C brands and published case studies including Bewakoof, Snitch, Libas, Kama Ayurveda, Plum, Sugar, WOW Skin Science, Fabelia + 50-piece D2C content clusters for skincare + jewelry + fashion.
